diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 84c9fcb..11819c1 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,27 @@
 # Next
 
+## Changes
+
+- 项目更名为 560-Mesh，统一管理台、登录页及浏览器标题；公开下载页仍使用管理员设置的站点名称。
+
+- 系统设置新增公开首页站点标题，保存后刷新即显示；公开下载首页提供官方客户端入口及带图标的三步接入教程，不展示管理入口和服务端配置。
+
+- 自建 DERP 支持多个地址、独立 STUN 与逐项检测，兼容原单地址配置；顶栏提供显眼的官方客户端下载按钮。
+
+- 新建设备接入配置默认不接受服务器 DNS，开启空白子网路由列表时自动建议 192.168.0.0/24；首次初始化默认启用用户隔离，保留现有自定义策略和明确的管理选择。
+
+- 增加用户互通开关、隔离策略预览与冲突保护；可选择官方或自建 DERP，直接填写地址并检测，保存后自动应用并在启动失败时回退。
+
+- 加入命令新增默认关闭的“强制重新认证”选项，可保存并复制包含 --force-reauth 的命令。
+
+- Refresh the management console with grouped navigation, clearer device and enrollment views, and accessible Motion transitions.
+
+- The Chinese console now saves universal enrollment commands with configurable client options and persistent full pre-authentication keys, supports explicit key deletion, and defaults new reusable keys to 999 days.
+
+- The 560 platform edition uses `/adminis/` for all management routes, assets and cookies. The old `/admin` entry is unavailable. The login page and navigation use 560 branding and Chinese labels. Headscale protocol behavior is unchanged.
+- Management pages, validation, dialogs, accessibility labels, time formatting and editor controls use Simplified Chinese while protocol identifiers and user data stay intact.
+- Administrators can sign in with local usernames and salted scrypt password hashes. Persistent lockout, request throttling, password changes, session revocation and an offline account recovery CLI protect these accounts. The Headscale API key stays on the server.
+
 # 0.8.2 (October 22, 2026)
 
 This release contains an important security update for Headplane that protects against the [compromised eMudhra intermediate CAs](https://emudhra.com/en/post/certificate-security-incident) with Node.js 24.22.1 and Go 1.27.3. Any native installations should also upgrade to these versions and rebuild the agent.
